        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "***1.7 Have you demonstrated progress against your concept in the form of a minimum viable product (MVP), working prototype, or beta you can share as part of your application?****"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "bulletList",
